    "updated_at": "2020-04-11T16:52:18Z",
    "body": "I was thinking about an alternative approach to this by using [kube-rs](https://github.com/clux/kube-rs) client to parse the config unfortunately this isn't possible at the moment as kube-rs doesn't support parsing stacked configs at all (see https://github.com/clux/kube-rs/issues/132) but this might be something to consider in the future, especially once https://github.com/clux/kube-rs/issues/204 is completed.",
